  "description": "Step into a world of electrifying creativity with our Neon Afterlife Digital Paper collection! Immerse yourself in the vibrant glow of neon hues, each design celebrating the iconic sugar skull motif with a psychedelic twist. Whether you are crafting edgy party invitations, designing captivating scrapbook layouts, or adding a bold pop of color to your digital projects, our Neon Afterlife Digital Paper will transport you to a realm of vivid and artistic inspiration. Let the neon colors electrify your imagination as you embark on a creative journey that’s equal parts fun and mesmerizing. It’s time to create something that’s brilliantly bold and wildly unique! 💀🌈✨\nEnhance your creative projects with this versatile set of digital scrapbook papers! Perfect for a wide range of applications, including greeting cards, invitations, printable projects, party packs, paper crafts, stickers, wedding invitations, gift wrapping, sublimation, fabric, digital scrapbooking, blog backgrounds, photo albums, scrapbooks, and so much more!\nℹ️ ***ITEM DETAILS*** ℹ️\n* Set of 12 Seamless Digital Paper files compressed in a zip folder.\n* File Format: JPEG\n* Sheet size: 12×12 inches and 300DPI.\n* Printing at home? Patterns can also be printed on 8.5×11-inch paper—just remember to disable the “Scale To Fit” printing option",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step into a world of electrifying creativity with our Neon Afterlife Digital Paper collection! Immerse yourself in the vibrant glow of neon hues, each design celebrating the iconic sugar skull motif with a psychedelic twist. Whether you are crafting edgy party invitations, designing captivating scrapbook layouts, or adding a bold pop of color to your digital projects, our Neon Afterlife Digital Paper will transport you to a realm of vivid and artistic inspiration. Let the neon colors electrify your imagination as you embark on a creative journey that’s equal parts fun and mesmerizing. It’s time to create something that’s brilliantly bold and wildly unique! 💀🌈✨</p>\n<p>Enhance your creative projects with this versatile set of digital scrapbook papers! Perfect for a wide range of applications, including greeting cards, invitations, printable projects, party packs, paper crafts, stickers, wedding invitations, gift wrapping, sublimation, fabric, digital scrapbooking, blog backgrounds, photo albums, scrapbooks, and so much more!</p>\n<p>ℹ️ ***ITEM DETAILS*** ℹ️<br>\n* Set of 12 Seamless Digital Paper files compressed in a zip folder.<br>\n* File Format: JPEG<br>\n* Sheet size: 12×12 inches and 300DPI.<br>\n* Printing at home? Patterns can also be printed on 8.5×11-inch paper—just remember to disable the “Scale To Fit” printing option</p>",
